  "scope": "frozen per-fixture dependency-edge inventory (event id -> sorted depends_on set), event endpoints (tick, entity_id, place_id), relation endpoint triples (from, to, type), and JSON content digests for the crossing continuation chain; no chronology truth, entailment, source, rights, or canon judgment; --freeze is scope-guarded to corpus/fixtures/** and every pin records the fixture's repo-relative path, which verification enforces (SCOPE-REFUSED / PATH-MISMATCH)",
